Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:49.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,《铁血战士》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来很精神 达奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking good, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久不见了 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去里面谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,18小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen hours ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这小国失去一架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}we lost a chopper carrying a cabinet minister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面载着内阁成员及其助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his aide from this charming little country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到的讯号显示 他们的位置大约在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a transponder fix on their position about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位内阁成员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cabinet minister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢乱窜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does he always travel on the wrong side of the border?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是直升机偏离原定航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently they strayed off course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定落入了游击队手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're fairly certain they're in guerrilla hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不用正规部队去营救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you use the regular army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而要用我们这些特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need us for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有笨蛋认为你们是最好的 指定要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause some damned fool accused you of being the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄龙！你这贱人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dillon! You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA让你坐太久办公室吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA got you pushing too many pencils?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以放轻松些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it easy on yourself, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…好吧…好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK! OK, OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不知什么时候该停\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never knew when to quit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴又见到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这条领带算是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this fucking tie business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 别谈我的领带啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Forget about my tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你在柏林的那次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about that job you pulled in Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美漂亮 达奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像美好的旧时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 美好的旧时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I like the good old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不参加利比亚的那次行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how come you passed on Libya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰炸不是我喜欢的作战方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't my style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可没有特定的作战方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no style. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不肯参加呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you pass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是拯救小组…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a rescue team…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是暗杀小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}not assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次的任务是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do we got to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位内阁成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cabinet minister's important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们在这地区很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our scope of operations in this part of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,达奇 将军的意思是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The general's saying a couple of our friends are about to get squeezed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要最好的小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的小组在此的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单的行动 一天就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple setup. One- day operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到直升机那里寻找游击队的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pick up their trail at the chopper, grab those hostages, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,救出人质 在他们发现之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bounce back, and cross the border…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经越过边境回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}before anybody knows we were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in with you, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 你知道我的队伍一向是单独行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, my team always works alone. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 少校 我们各有各的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our orders, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦完成任务后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you reach your objective…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄龙将接管这次行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dillon will evaluate the situation and take charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地已标在地图上 无线电频道也已调好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendezvous points and radio freqs are indicated and fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每四小时跟指挥部联络一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}AWACs contact on four- hour intervals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是我们的支援？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's our backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有支援 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such thing, ol' buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是单程任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a one- way ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越过边界 一切就只能靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we cross that border, we're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这任务越听越有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is getting better by the minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利！有天我去我女朋友那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Billy. The other day, I went up to my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对她说 「我想跟你做爱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, l'd like a little pussy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 「我也是 我的跟房子一样大」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said, "Me, too. Mine's as big as a house!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 她希望性器小 因为她的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she wanted a littler one 'cause hers was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟房子一样大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}big as a house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那恶心的烟草拿远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that stinking shit out of my face, will ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是愚蠢的无能弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of slack- jawed faggots around here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟草可令你跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff will make you a damn sexual tyrannosaurus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,成性超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞到屁眼里去吧 布雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Strap this on your sore ass, Blain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这打火机是72年在北越\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was in '72.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟达奇各得一个作奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Dutch both got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚼烟草真的是个很恶心的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a real nasty habit you got there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我多怀念跟你一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never knew how much I missed this, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥时有这么聪明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never were that smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍金斯 去吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawkins, you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lines away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机是头部中弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pilots have each got one round in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抢走了里面所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever hit it, stripped the shit out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队是用热导弹把它击落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took him out with a heat- seeker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ehn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一架普通的直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no ordinary army taxi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来更像侦查机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks more like a surveillance bird to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们留下的足迹了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up the trail yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利正在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄龙 这事越来越复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat- seeker, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队怎么会有热导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty sophisticated for half- assed mountain boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们的装备越来越好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they're getting better equipped every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来有12个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were 12 guerrillas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队把他们从直升机捉走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took the two men from the helicopter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 还有别的足迹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有六个穿美国陆军军鞋的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six men wearing US- issued army boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从北方来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came in from the north{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一路追踪那些游击队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they followed the guerrillas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只是另一组游击队罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just another rebel patrol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们经常在这一带出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}They operate in here all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去看看能发现些什么 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See what you can find. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利找到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队捉走了两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guerrillas hauling two guys in the chopper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一些穿美军装备的人追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed by men with American equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.06,0:14:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得上次在阿富汗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember Afghanistan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试把它忘记吧！来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to forget it. Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛丽亚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米·霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jim Hopper."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 将他们放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, cut them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得他是北卡州部队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew these men. Green Berets out of Fort Bragg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were they doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 达奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不人道了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is inhuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人告诉我这区域有活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody told me there was an operation in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shouldn't have been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人派他们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody sent them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队把他们剥皮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guerrillas skinned them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要这样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they skin them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,军人不应是这样死法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way for no soldier to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 到底发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾经发生枪战\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a fire fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向四面八方盲目射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were shooting in all directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想像吉米会走进埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe Jim Hopper walked into an ambush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他中了埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到半点痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find a single track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍普其他的队员呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of Hopper's men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他们的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sign, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本没有离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never left here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像突然消失了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it's like they just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续追踪游击队的足迹 我们去救人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick with the guerrilla trail. Let's get the hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人隔5公尺 不要作声！\N{\fnArial\fs30}five- meter spread. No sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候把武器拿出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to let Old Painless out of the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,血债血偿的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payback time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这讨厌的家伙在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ghostin' us, mother fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who you are back in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再不小心暴露行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give our position one more time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会神不知鬼不觉的让你流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bleed you real quiet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你留下来等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听清楚了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了一个人质！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed one of the hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.27,0:21:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:22:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克和布雷对付机枪堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, Blain…the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利和宾对付警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, Poncho…the guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍金斯和狄龙作支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawkins, Dillon…backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切布署好后 我便攻击他们的燃料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they're set, I hit the fuel dump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.45,0:24:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.63,0:24:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演时间到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show time, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是中央那房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target's the center, on the upper level!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心九点方向！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dutch, on your nine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.15,0:26:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决那个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.99,0:27:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉在此处吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人质在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostages are inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去追截他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍金斯 通知指挥部我们现在的位置及状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawkins, call in position and situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.05,0:27:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,用无线电跟指挥部联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Connor for the hook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 少校！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.70,0:28:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.13,0:28:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到其他的人质吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}any sign of the other hostage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.67,0:28:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到另外一个 也已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found the other guy. He's dead, too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.14,0:28:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还找到从直升机拆下的齿轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the kid from the chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们是中美洲人 那我就是中国人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they're Central American, l'm a Goddamn Chinaman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说那阁员应是CIA\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the looks of it, our cabinet minister was CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我们运气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another thing, Major. We were lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了游击队外 还有苏联军事顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other guys we waxed…Russian military advisers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.95,0:28:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有大规模军事计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something pretty big was gonna happen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.56,0:28:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理一下现场 不要留下蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the area. No traces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫大家准备离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the men ready to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.39,0:28:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.77,0:28:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那杂种待在那里死也不走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch is dug in like an Alabama tick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.21,0:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你中了弹 在流血！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hit. You're bleeding, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't got time to bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.48,0:28:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时间躲一躲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got time to duck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.43,0:29:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈漂亮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is goddamn beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.10,0:29:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,中正头奖！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn jackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.24,0:29:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比想像中更多机密！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is more than we ever thought we'd get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we got those bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉个正着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.11,0:29:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这才是你要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is what you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set us up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.21,0:29:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我的都是废话 你骗我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all bullshit! All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么内阁成员等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cabinet minister, the whole business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗我们来这里替你卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got us in here to do your dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚阻止一次大型入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just stopped a major invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本来三天内便会侵略\N{\fnArial\fs30}In three days, they'd have crossed the border with the stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么挑我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没其他人能完成这任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nobody else could've pulled it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗你是因为不这样的话你不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissed about the cover story? I needed it to get you in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你告诉霍普什么样的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What story did you hand Hopper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.67,0:29:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花了几个月才找到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we've been looking for this place for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那架直升机被击中时 我的手下在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men were in that chopper when it got hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.14,0:29:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍普是要来拯救我的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopper was supposed to get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.97,0:29:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他却不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.87,0:29:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有失踪 他是被活活的剥了皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't disappear. He was skinned alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.94,0:29:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的命令就是 送能消灭凶手的人到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My orders were to get somebody to crack these bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.65,0:29:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你编故事骗我们来送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you cooked up a story and dropped us in a meat grinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.45,0:30:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 狄龙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, Dillon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.11,0:30:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前是个值得信赖的人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to be somebody I could trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.36,0:30:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不能醒过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是项资产…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an asset…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一项可以牺牲的资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}an expendable asset…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用你来完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I used you to get the job done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.17,0:30:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下不是可以随便牺牲的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are not expendable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.78,0:30:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不做这种事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't do this kind of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.78,0:30:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校！少校！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major! Major!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.18,0:30:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stepped into some real shit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.59,0:30:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中侦查说到处都是游击队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air surveillance says we got guerillas all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.89,0:30:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在一两公里范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be more than one, two miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大概多久会到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个小时内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half hour, maybe less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.29,0:30:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉麦克 五分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Mac we move in five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 她跟我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. She goes with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.90,0:30:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's too valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.73,0:30:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定知道整个部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got the whole of that work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一有机会便会泄露我们行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll give away our position any chance she gets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.93,0:30:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 你必须听我命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still under orders, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下命令还是由我来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna make that call or should I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.61,0:30:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己负责看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your baggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.71,0:31:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟不上的话 便自理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fall behind, and you're on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.35,0:31:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机在这里升降太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place is too hot for a pickup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.06,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会在这里接我们 除非我们越过边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't touch us till we get over the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.63,0:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利！哪条路可以离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Billy, give me a way out of this hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.23,0:31:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中侦查说我们被包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerial says we're cut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的出路是那山谷 它会把我们引向东边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way out is that valley that leads east…{\r}
