Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.87,0:54:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的要求不被接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request for extraction denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.88,0:54:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的位置仍旧暴露在敌人的火力网下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Area is still compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.65,0:54:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前进到3000位置 我们在那里接你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed to sector 3, 000 for prisoner extraction. Priority, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.55,0:54:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次联络时间是9：30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next contact 0930.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.38,0:54:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 火焰一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Blazer one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.19,0:54:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,10：30联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}10:30 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.75,0:54:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.86,0:54:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们的位置还太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say we're still in too far, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.26,0:54:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能冒险前来接我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they can't risk coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.26,0:54:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是资产 狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're assets, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.06,0:54:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以牺牲的资产！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expendable assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.76,0:54:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,CIA就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes with the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.46,0:54:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我可以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.37,0:54:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说 你跟我们一样生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit. You're just like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.07,0:54:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机不会来这里就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shitload of good a chopper's gonna do us in here anyhow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.91,0:54:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,士官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.18,0:55:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,士官！士官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant! Sergeant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.28,0:55:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天谁攻击我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hit us today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.38,0:55:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.29,0:55:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看到一个有伪装的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only saw one of them camouflaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.39,0:55:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对眼睛…忽然消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those eyes disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.73,0:55:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对眼睛 他们…他们消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those eyes, they…they disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.63,0:55:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道一件事 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one thing, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.30,0:55:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对准向它射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drew down and fired straight at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.94,0:55:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我射了200轮以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capped off 200 rounds in the minigun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.31,0:55:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把所有子弹射光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.21,0:55:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一点用处也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.01,0:55:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上没有什么东西 在那个范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing on this earth could have lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.41,0:55:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能生存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at that range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.22,0:55:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你站第一班 然后去休息一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, you take first watch then you get some rest, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.06,0:55:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问她看到什么？问她霍金斯怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her what she saw. Ask her what happened to Hawkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.56,0:55:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,问她吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.29,0:55:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.39,0:56:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林活过来把他抓走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.68,0:56:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same fucking thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.18,0:56:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林活过来把他抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jungle, it came alive and took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.85,0:56:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你一定知道些什么 到底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, you know something. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.38,0:56:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, Poncho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.29,0:56:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,放屁！你不怕任何人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit. You ain't afraid of no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.96,0:56:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有东西在等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something out there waiting for us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.09,0:56:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且并不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.77,0:56:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.51,0:56:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙已经失去理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's losing it. He's losing his cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.68,0:56:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是有些敌人在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but a couple guys running around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.88,0:56:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we gotta take 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.51,0:56:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是不明白 狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still don't understand, Dillon, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.62,0:56:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is out there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.39,0:56:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它杀了霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}it killed Hopper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.49,0:56:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它要杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now it wants us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are again, bro…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.23,0:57:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.70,0:57:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样的月亮 一样的丛林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same kind of moon, same kind of jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚我们喝酒来壮胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real number- ten night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.11,0:57:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.74,0:57:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole platoon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.44,0:57:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,32个人都被剁成肉酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}32 men chopped into meat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.91,0:57:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we walk out, just you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.31,0:57:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.02,0:57:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最好的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on top of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.42,0:57:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本不算一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a scratch. Not a fucking scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.05,0:57:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道不管是谁把你杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, whoever got you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.86,0:57:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll come back again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.32,0:57:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他敢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when he does…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.13,0:57:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你的名字刻在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to cut your name into him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.48,0:57:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.96,0:57:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.71,0:57:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在那里 麦克？- 在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you? - Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.23,0:58:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.96,0:58:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.06,0:58:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.37,0:58:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.48,0:58:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.18,0:58:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉逮到你了 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, mother fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.22,0:58:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed you, you fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.29,0:58:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你杀了一只猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you killed a pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.03,0:58:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是应该找只大点的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you could have found something bigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.20,0:58:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 去你妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Poncho. Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.53,0:58:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.50,0:58:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.61,0:58:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没人看着她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell wasn't anybody watching her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.41,0:58:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么没有逃走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't she try to get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看她 她吓坏了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her. She's scared out of her mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.72,0:59:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 你最好来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major, you better take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.46,0:59:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷的尸体不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blain's body, it's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.66,0:59:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它避过了我们设下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came in through the tripwires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.06,0:59:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们面前把布雷带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took it right out from under our noses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.45,0:59:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那只猪误触陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boar had to set off a tripflare…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.65,0:59:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没有其它足印\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there ain't no other tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.65,0:59:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么有人能通过陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could anyone get through this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走布雷又不让我们发觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and carry out Blain without us knowing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.06,0:59:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指他为什么没杀人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he try and kill one of us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来只是拿那尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to get the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.46,0:59:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一次只杀一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's killing us one at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.00,0:59:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像猎人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.98,1:00:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是利用这些树潜进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using the trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天你看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, what did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.80,1:00:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.60,1:00:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再跟我们玩把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.31,1:00:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it was. It…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.01,1:00:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.21,1:00:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会变颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changed colors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.15,1:00:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像变色龙一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the chameleon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.65,1:00:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它利用这丛林\N{\fnArial\fs30}It uses the jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.12,1:00:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他们是被蜥蜴杀死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blain and Hawkins were killed by a lizard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.46,1:00:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,发什么神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bullshit psych job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.62,1:00:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面最多只有两三人在活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 2 or 3 men out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.56,1:00:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking lizard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.13,1:00:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.03,1:00:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.54,1:01:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西在追捕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thing is hunting us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.44,1:01:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.35,1:01:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.98,1:01:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要这里的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.05,1:01:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带她回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm taking her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.75,1:01:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五分钟后就要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.15,1:01:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.26,1:01:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 救援部队很快便到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rendezvous is ten miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.26,1:01:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为直升机会等我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the chopper's going to wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.76,1:01:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄龙 我们必须共同抵抗敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make a stand now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.36,1:01:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则谁都不能活着出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or nobody will be left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.96,1:01:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.27,1:01:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大个子被杀的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the big man was killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.87,1:01:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定弄伤了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must have wounded it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.10,1:01:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的血滴在树叶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its blood was on the leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.91,1:01:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它会流血 那么我们就能杀掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it bleeds, we can kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.57,1:02:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.53,1:02:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这童子军玩意有效？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think this Boy Scout bullshit's gonna work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.13,1:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能看到那些金属线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can see tripwires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.96,1:02:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可能看不到这陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it can't see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.17,1:02:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话了 赶紧帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of complaining, maybe you should help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.90,1:03:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么你认为它一定会走这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think he'll come through here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.20,1:03:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,50码半径内的每棵树上 都绑上了金属线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trees have tripwires every 50 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.80,1:03:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是剩下的唯一通路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.36,1:04:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还是小孩子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was little, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.96,1:04:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来像被屠宰过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked like…like butchered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.07,1:04:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,村里的老女人一直画十字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old women in the village crossed themselves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.87,1:04:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷着疯狂 奇怪的祷词\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whispered crazy things, such strange things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.54,1:04:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼奉献
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.48,1:04:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在最热的年份 才会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in the hottest years this happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.15,1:04:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今年也非常的热\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this year, it grows hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.26,1:04:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始找到那些男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We begin finding our men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.46,1:04:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些被剥了皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found them sometimes without their skin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.05,1:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时更可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes much, much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.17,1:04:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼奉献的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.91,1:04:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼把男人当作他的战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means "the demon who makes trophies of man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.80,1:05:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下回要用什么作饵 芝士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna try next, cheese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.70,1:05:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,达奇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dutch. Dutch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.07,1:06:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.31,1:07:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉到你了！捉到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, you mother! I got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.85,1:07:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来追你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.12,1:07:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac! Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.32,1:07:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他到直升机那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Ramirez to the chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.12,1:07:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.82,1:07:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 达奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.42,1:07:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去追麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.82,1:07:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像你的一贯作风 狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your style, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.32,1:07:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你这学了些坏习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked up bad habits from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.93,1:07:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your people the hell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.06,1:07:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能赢的 狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win this, Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can get even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.23,1:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄龙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dillon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.64,1:07:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要叫那直升机等我和麦克回来就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold onto that damn chopper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.55,1:07:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他伤得很重 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busted up pretty bad, Major.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.49,1:07:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以捱得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it. I can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:07:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走无线电 其它的都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the radio. Forget the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.66,1:08:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.09,1:08:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！宾 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Poncho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.86,1:08:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.54,1:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,高个子萨丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Long tall Sally"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.59,1:08:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常甜美\N{\fnArial\fs30}"she's built sweet!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.34,1:08:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She got everything that Uncle John need"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.76,1:08:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, baby"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.10,1:08:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Baby"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.47,1:08:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点快乐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm gonna have me some fun"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.18,1:08:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点快乐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm gonna have me some fun"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.53,1:09:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.93,1:09:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.54,1:09:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.98,1:09:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.49,1:09:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.29,1:09:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.16,1:09:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在那里 在那些树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there. Past them trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:10:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.22,1:10:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.89,1:10:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.43,1:10:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们可以杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we can get this thing, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.20,1:10:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你慢慢爬过去接近它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work your way down there toward him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.40,1:10:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在上头逼近它后面 把它赶去你处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get in back of him, flush him toward you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.71,1:10:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我赶那杂种时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I flush the son of a bitch, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.01,1:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you nail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.41,1:10:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个血海深仇要报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a score to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.15,1:10:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有仇要报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've both got scores to settle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.10,1:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快！我们快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Quickly! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.54,1:12:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拿！它没杀你是因为你没武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Leave it. It didn't kill you because you weren't armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.61,1:12:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对它来说太没趣味！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.15,1:12:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mac. Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.39,1:13:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.73,1:14:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.65,1:14:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.15,1:14:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.77,1:15:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我武器 给我武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.16,1:15:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.66,1:16:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.05,1:16:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去直升机那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the chopper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.60,1:17:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.43,1:20:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看不见我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.51,1:32:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,流血吧 杂种！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleed, bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.82,1:35:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的丑得很！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one ugly motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.64,1:36:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意真差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.66,1:38:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.46,1:38:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.40,1:38:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀我 我在这里！杀我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Come on. Kill me! l'm here! Kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.37,1:38:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀我！我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm here! kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.58,1:38:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀我！我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kill me! l'm here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.48,1:38:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 现在来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, do it now! Kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.56,1:39:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you?{\r}
